# L2-FLT-003: a 0x2000 continuation shares its errored parent's filter fate.
# Three records, the third differing from the parent in EVERY filtered
# dimension, so each filter case shows what happens to the pair alone:
#
#   parent        RT15  SA11  Receive   BC_TO_RT  bus A   ERRORED  @ .456225
#   continuation  (no RT / SA)          SPURIOUS  bus A   0x2000   (stamped .456504,
#                                                                  reported at .456225)
#   other         RT3   SA22  Transmit  RT_TO_BC  bus B   clean    @ .457187

# Errored RT15 SA11 Receive with one captured payload word and DDC error 0x011E.
02470F1826DB21F6
7E79 0004 1E01

# SPURIOUS_DATA continuation with two raw words.
20060F1826DB38F7
AAAA BBBB

# Clean RT3 SA22 Transmit on bus B (errors-inline's last record, RT and bus
# changed; its Status Word carries RT3 to match).
84240F1826DBE3F9
DE1E 0018
2010 8241 0000 0815 0000 0000 0000 0000
00FE 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000
0000 0000 0300 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000
0000 0020 0000 0000 0000 0000
